The repository also supplies an MIT license; retain WinJS-REPOSITORY-LICENSE.

Modifications in WinUI Portable Icons: selected glyphs remapped to WinUI PUA
codepoints, scaled to 2048 units/em, fitted to numeric ink/advance metrics,
merged with Fluent System Icons and original geometric recipes, and repackaged
as WOFF with a one-em line box. Windows Segoe font outlines are not included.
The resulting font is a modified work, not the original Microsoft font.
